  "notes": "{枯渇|こかつ} combines {枯|か}れる (to wither, dry up) and {渇|かわ}く (to dry up, be thirsty), creating a strong image of complete depletion.\n\nUsage:\n- {枯渇|こかつ}する (to become depleted, run dry)\n- {枯渇|こかつ}させる (to deplete, exhaust)\n\nCommonly used with:\n- {資源|しげん} (resources)\n- {資金|しきん} (funds)\n- {水源|すいげん} (water sources)\n- アイデア (ideas)\n- {体力|たいりょく} (physical energy)\n\nRelated words:\n- {底|そこ}をつく: to run out, be exhausted\n- {尽|つ}きる: to be used up\n- {払底|ふってい}: running out, becoming scarce",
